<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia sees budget surplus in 1997.</title>
<headline>Malaysia sees budget surplus in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prime Minister Mahathir Mohamad said on Friday that he was confident that Malaysia will register a budget surplus for 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;I am sure we can show a budget surplus in 1997,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>&quot;Notwithstanding the recent volatility (in the markets), the economy remains fundamentally strong,&quot; Mahathir said at the opening at the new Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange building.</p>
